                "recommended": "<strong>Recomendados:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Notas adicionais:</strong> You can use the following controllers for this game; M/K, Xbox 360 Controller, Xbox One Controller, PS3/PS4 controllers, PS3/4 Rock Band Guitars, XB Rock Band Guitars, our Custom &quot;The Metronomicon&quot; Dance Pad, plus the majority of USB Dance Pads (sadly we haven't tested them all so there is no guarantee on these)</li></ul>"
